# Ventas del mostrador (cambiar branchId y variantId).
### Tickets de hoy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales/3/today

### Cobrar en efectivo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    { "variantId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "payments": [
    { "method": "EFECTIVO", "amount": 8400.00 }
  ]
}

### Cobro mixto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    { "variantId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "payments": [
    { "method": "EFECTIVO", "amount": 8000.00 },
    { "method": "DEBITO", "amount": 8800.00 }
  ]
}
